{"availability":"available","full":"ErickWendel/localstudio","name":"localstudio","description":"Browser-only Canva-style presentation studio, powered by local Web AI.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":614,"forks":35,"created":"2026-06-24T19:24:25Z","updated":"2026-10-01T14:38:38Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://localstudio.dev/","topics":["chrome","chrome-built-in-ai","chrome-language-detection-api","chrome-prompt-api","chrome-translate-api","huggingface","huggingface-transformers","prompt-api","speech-to-text","transformers-js","webai"],"demo":"https://localstudio.dev/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T23:31:00.099Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T23:31:00.099Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T23:31:00.099Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T21:32:55.011Z","stars":613,"forks":34},{"at":"2026-10-07T23:31:00.099Z","stars":614,"forks":35}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["LocalStudio.dev is a browser-native slide editor for people who want editable decks without handing the whole workflow to a remote workspace.","Cloud presentation tools are convenient until sync becomes the product risk. LocalStudio exists for a practical reason: iCloud sync issues can lose or corrupt entire presentations, and translating a deck manually is still slow. LocalStudio keeps the deck as editable local layers and can translate the whole deck with one action when the browser AI setup is ready.","It turns PowerPoint (.pptx) import, prompt generation, image creation, translation, background removal, presenter-mode PWA remote control, live speech transcripts, public audience Q&A, local project history, and S3-compatible projects into one editable slide workflow."],"features":["The landing page now walks through the full LocalStudio loop with short product demos. Each step keeps the deck editable instead of producing a locked screenshot.","PowerPoint (.pptx) import turns existing decks into editable LocalStudio projects.","Presenter mode adds speaker notes, slide controls, fullscreen playback, and PWA remote control over peer-to-peer browser connections.","Live speech transcription can record the presenter's voice with the native Speech-to-Text API, open the transcript in a separate accessibility window, and carry that transcript into the public view.","Prompt-to-slide creates structured text, image, and shape layers instead of a flat bitmap."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ErickWendel/localstudio/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fd1be80c3430d83251871d92a1955f56e78d1f1be3a96c59e0ed711b404a943b","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:55.087Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:55.087Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"LocalStudio.dev is a browser-native slide editor for people who want editable decks without handing the whole workflow to a remote workspace.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ErickWendel/localstudio/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Root console login: localstudio-root / localstudio-root123","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ErickWendel/localstudio/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"fd1be80c3430d83251871d92a1955f56e78d1f1be3a96c59e0ed711b404a943b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ErickWendel/localstudio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:55.088Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-01T14:38:38Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ErickWendel/localstudio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:55.089Z","hash":"fd1be80c3430d83251871d92a1955f56e78d1f1be3a96c59e0ed711b404a943b","originalBytes":14510,"storedBytes":14510,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["public","local","editor","landing","apps","localstudio","project","browser","deck","editable","webmcp","api","minio","mirrored","run","s3-compatible","showcase","slide","assets","bucket","image","npm","remote","import","fonts","key","model",